about 185 units, plus leftovers, run into the 196-unit capacity, so some of product 1 is lost on arrival.\n- **Daily (4):** fees rise by 406 and holding falls by about 270, so net it's about 130 worse than every 2 days. Its quantities are about 10% above the mean, like candidate 0's.\n\n**The two-day plans.**\n\n| Candidate | Product 0 | Product 1 | Comment |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 7 | ≈ 713 | ≈ 796 | Right at the mean; the cheapest plan with acceptable shortages |\n| 0 | 784 | 875 | About +10%; fewer shortages, but extra purchases cost more than they save on product 1 |\n| 3 | 774 | 878 | Same as 0, but a larger early product 1 order (70 vs 54) and a smaller last order (less end waste); slightly better than 0 |\n| 2 | ≈ 843 | ≈ 940 | Over-orders; roughly −800 versus 0 |\n| 5 | ≈ 750 | 972 | Product 1 surplus about 177; worse still |\n\n**Every 3 days:** candidate 6 is about −150 versus candidate 0, plus losses from overflow. Candidate 1 heavily over-orders product 1 and overflows more, so it's the worst.\n\n**Ranking:** 7 ≈ 3 > 0 > 4 ≈ 6 > 2 > 5 > 1."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4934, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4934}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:03:30.248Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWBJ5xjchLcJJZFBG5Eq"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_014gQbzyyQHxZXFEhWXiDULZ", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"